"Featuring flexible gaskets for greater comfort and more natural movement, along with a convenient range of chest connector port options, the Levin from Caldera has been a practical choice for explorers everywhere. This particular undersuit has been repaired for extended use.",
"Built for adventure but comfortable enough for everyday, the Markanda undersuit has become beloved by explorers. A unique patchwork design creates a flexible yet resilient undersuit, while an odor resistant SureSoft inner lining will keep you from wanting to take it off. This particular undersuit has been repaired for extended use.",
