"The Behring P6-LR ballistic sniper rifle more than makes up for its slow rate of fire with a high powered round that's effective from long range. Featuring a scope with variable zoom modes and a barrel composed of a proprietary high-strength alloy, the P6-LR was designed to deliver when needed most.",
